{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21213","headline":"三叹 一 · 元稹","name":"三叹 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤劒锋刀涩，犹能神彩生。\n有时雷雨过，暗吼阗阗声。\n主人閟灵宝，畏作升天行。\n淬砺当阳铁，刻爲干镆名。\n远求鸊鹈莹，同用玉匣盛。\n颜色纵相类，利钝颇相倾。\n雄爲光电烻，雌但深泓澄。\n龙怒有奇变，青蛇终不惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}